  UnitStory: "IShowSpeed \u2013 \"C\u1ED7 m\xE1y g\u1EA7m r\xFA\" c\u1EE7a l\xE0ng
    streamer th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi v\u1EDBi ngu\u1ED3n n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng v\xF4
    t\u1EADn \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c \u0111\xF4i khi b\u1EA5t \u1ED5n t\xE2m l\xFD.
    N\u1ED5i ti\u1EBFng nh\u1EDD nh\u1EEFng pha s\u1EE7a ti\u1EBFng g\xE2u g\xE2u
    hoang d\u1EA1i, nh\u1EEFng m\xE0n nh\u1EA3y qua si\xEAu xe Lamborghini ngh\u1EB9t
    th\u1EDF, v\xE0 l\xF2ng trung th\xE0nh tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i d\xE0nh cho idol
    Cristiano Ronaldo (\"Siuuu\"). T\u1EEB m\u1ED9t c\u1EADu nh\xF3c g\xE0o th\xE9t
    tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\xE0n h\xECnh ch\u01A1i game, anh ch\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFn
    ngu\u1ED3n n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng \"kh\xF9ng \u0111i\xEAn\" \u0111\xF3 th\xE0nh
    m\u1ED9t h\u1EC7 t\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng gi\u1EA3i tr\xED to\xE0n c\u1EA7u, c\xE0n
    qu\xE9t t\u1EEB v\xF5 \u0111\xE0i WWE cho \u0111\u1EBFn c\xE1c tour stream n\xE1o
    lo\u1EA1n m\u1ECDi qu\u1ED1c gia \u0111i qua!"
